  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n==='''Secret Decorations'''===\n[[File:Secret Coffin.png|150px|left]] The '''Secret Coffin''' can only be won by tapping the ghost which occasionally appears in the [[fishing]] area during Halloween. This decoration is animated. It is unlocked at [[experience]] level 27.\n{{Clr}}\nFour decorations can only be caught in the [[fishing]] lake with a [[Net Maker|Mystery Net]] and a hefty dose of luck. Mystery nets are unlocked at [[experience]] level 30.\n<gallery hideaddbutton=\"true\">\nAnchor.png\nCannon.png\nPearl of the Sea.png\nShip Wheel.png\n</gallery>\n{{Clr}}\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Decoraciones/Secretas\n}}\n\n[[Category:Decorations]]",
